  "description": {
    "text": "The 2007 Spring Collector's Tins held four EX Series booster packs and a cosmos holofoil card not found in packs. Tins sold outside North America held POP Series ex cards: Tyranitar ex, Celebi ex or Ho-Oh ex, the first two already sold in earlier bonus boxes. North American tins held the Diamond & Pearl starter Pokémon Turtwig, Chimchar or Piplup, which Special Edition blister packs brought to other Western countries in June 2007.",
